shi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0011"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"溉父坦，南史、梁書兩傳相合。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete-4-330","title":"左民尚書","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"6bo_qfq_pl9_ABB","attestations":[{"id":"th-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete-4-330:a","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004","start":330,"end":334,"surface":"左民尚書","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004:m0328","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-027","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete-ws1511478","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004","quote":"二年，遷司徒主簿，直待詔省，敕使抄甲部書。五年，遷尚書殿中郎。洽兄弟羣從，遞居此職，時人榮之。七年，遷太子中舍人，與庶子陸倕對掌東宮管記。俄爲侍讀，侍讀省仍置學士二人，洽復充其選。九年，遷國子博士，奉敕撰《太學碑》。十二年，出爲臨川內史，在郡稱職。十四年，入爲太子家令，遷給事黃門侍郎，兼國子博士。十六年，行太子中庶子。普通元年，以本官領博士。頃之，入爲尚書吏部郎，請託一無所行。俄遷員外散騎常侍，復領博士，母憂去職。五年，復爲太子中庶子，領步兵校尉，未拜，仍遷給事黃門侍郎，領尚書左丞。準繩不避貴戚，尚書省賄賂莫敢通。時鑾輿欲親戎，軍國容禮，多自洽出。六年，遷御史中丞，彈糾無所顧望，號爲勁直，當時肅清。以公事左降，猶居職。舊制，中丞不得入尚書下舍，洽兄溉爲左民尚書，洽引服親不應有礙，刺省詳決。左丞蕭子雲議許入溉省，亦以其兄弟素篤，不能相別也。七年，出爲貞威將軍、雲麾長史、尋陽太守。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004:m0328"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002","text":"洽年十八，爲南徐州迎西曹行事。洽少知名，清警有才學士行。謝朓文章盛於一時，見洽深相賞好，日引與談論。每謂洽曰：「君非直名人，乃亦兼資文武。」朓後爲吏部，洽去職，朓欲薦之，洽睹世方亂，深相拒絕。除晉安王國左常侍，不就。遂築室巖阿，幽居者積歲。樂安任昉有知人之鑒，與洽兄沼、溉並善。嘗訪洽於田舍，見之歎曰：「此子日下無雙。」遂申拜親之禮。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":28,"last_line":28,"raw_start":1321,"raw_end":1488,"raw_character_offsets":[1321,1322,1323,1324,1325,1326,1327,1328,1329,1330,1331,1332,1333,1334,1335,1336,1337,1338,1339,1340,1341,1342,1343,1344,1345,1346,1347,1348,1349,1350,1351,1352,1353,1354,1355,1356,1357,1358,1359,1360,1361,1362,1363,1364,1365,1366,1367,1368,1369,1370,1371,1372,1373,1374,1375,1376,1377,1378,1379,1380,1381,1382,1383,1384,1385,1386,1387,1388,1389,1390,1391,1392,1393,1394,1395,1396,1397,1398,1399,1400,1401,1402,1403,1404,1405,1406,1407,1408,1409,1410,1411,1412,1413,1414,1415,1416,1417,1418,1419,1420,1421,1422,1423,1424,1425,1426,1427,1428,1429,1430,1431,1432,1433,1434,1435,1436,1437,1438,1439,1440,1441,1442,1443,1444,1445,1446,1447,1448,1449,1450,1451,1452,1453,1454,1455,1456,1457,1458,1459,1460,1461,1462,1463,1464,1465,1466,1467,1468,1469,1470,1471,1472,1473,1474,1475,1476,1477,1478,1479,1480,1481,1482,1483,1484,1485,1486,1487],"revision_id":1511478},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"洽","kind":"person","person_id":"4mr_j4p_k5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"洽","kind":"person","person_id":"4mr_j4p_k5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"謝朓","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002:m0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"洽","kind":"person","person_id":"4mr_j4p_k5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002:m0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"洽","kind":"person","person_id":"4mr_j4p_k5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002:m0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"朓","kind":"person","person_id":